## Detailed File-by-File Breakdown

### 1. `src/index.html` (Modified)
- **Change**: Removed the external UX4G CDN script tag:
  ```diff
  - <script src="https://cdn.ux4g.gov.in/tools/accessibility-widget.js" async defer></script>
  ```
- **Why**: Hosting the accessibility widget locally eliminates remote CDN failures and prevents external CSS from overriding application buttons and colors at runtime.

---

### 2. `src/components/index.js` (Modified)
- **Change**: Added export for the local `AccessibilityWidget`:
  ```diff
  + export { default as AccessibilityWidget } from "./AccessibilityWidget";
  ```
- **Why**: Makes the widget accessible across components and top-level pages.

