### 8. `src/components/MuiTextField/index.js` (Modified)
- **Changes**:
  Injected accessible `aria-label` into `inputProps`:
  ```javascript
  inputProps={{
    maxLength,
    autocomplete: "new-password",
    spellCheck: false,
    // Accessibility: Provide explicit accessible label for screen readers and TTS
    "aria-label": typeof label === "string" ? label : name || "Input field",
  }}
  ```
- **Why**: Allows the Text-To-Speech engine and screen readers to immediately speak the field's actual label when hovering or focusing an input.

